---
title: "eat_donut (Sui Move Concepts: Object Destruction)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_unpack: let Donut { id } = d
    q_unpack --> q_delete: destructure donut object
    q_delete --> [*]: id.delete() - UID destroyed

    note right of q_unpack
        INV-001: Object is consumed by value (ownership transferred into function)
        INV-002: Destructuring extracts the UID for deletion
    end note

    note right of q_delete
        INV-003: UID must be explicitly deleted via id.delete()
        INV-004: After deletion, the object ID is permanently retired (never reused)
    end note
